  "catalyst_date": "2025-10-06",
  "catalyst_source": "https://investors.arcusbio.com/investors-and-media/press-releases/press-release-details/2025/Arcus-Biosciences-Presents-New-Data-for-its-HIF-2a-Inhibitor-Casdatifan-and-Discloses-First-Inflammation-Programs-at-Investor-Event/default.aspx",
  "catalyst_text": "Arcus announced new monotherapy results from the Phase 1/1b ARC-20 study of casdatifan in late-line metastatic ccRCC. In the pooled monotherapy cohorts (n=121), median PFS was 12.2 months and 18-month PFS was 43%. The 100 mg QD tablet cohort (the Phase 3 PEAK-1 dose) achieved a 35% confirmed ORR with median PFS not reached at about 12 months of follow-up. No unexpected safety signals were observed.",
